    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing... it doesn't feel temporary. it feels final. like the foundation is just gone. i spent thirty years building a life and a reputation, and it vanished in a week. how do you just 'move on' from being a pariah? there's no rebuilding from this. the version of me that people respected is dead. i'm just haunted by the ghost of him.",
